WEBVTT

01:33.583 --> 01:35.697
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:35.721 --> 01:38.017
(Adapted from the novel "A City, Waiting for You" by Jiuyuexi)

01:38.041 --> 01:40.867
(Episode 5)

01:44.124 --> 01:45.163
What's going on?

01:47.363 --> 01:49.044
How did you get that large wound?

01:49.564 --> 01:51.684
Dr Xu, did you give him a tetanus shot?

01:52.163 --> 01:53.163
I did.

01:53.243 --> 01:55.003
Remember to come and change your dressing as instructed.

01:56.924 --> 01:58.564
Put on your clothes in case you get a cold.

01:59.484 --> 02:00.443
Stand still.

02:01.083 --> 02:01.564
Here.

02:03.684 --> 02:04.283
Easy.

02:05.163 --> 02:05.803
This hand.

02:12.563 --> 02:13.284
Look at you.

02:13.484 --> 02:14.123
Does it hurt?

02:14.124 --> 02:15.283
Do you need painkiller?

02:15.284 --> 02:16.004
No.

02:17.204 --> 02:19.284
Take it. This isn't the time to play the hero.

02:19.764 --> 02:20.764
Isn't that right, Dr Xu?

02:21.803 --> 02:23.764
That depends on the patient.

02:28.204 --> 02:30.284
Your shoes got wet.

02:30.764 --> 02:32.763
Let me get you the clean slippers in my car.

02:32.764 --> 02:33.683
It's cold today.

02:34.083 --> 02:34.604
Never mind.

02:34.683 --> 02:35.403
Wait here.

02:40.044 --> 02:41.484
Is she your girlfriend?

02:46.683 --> 02:47.884
Does this have anything to do with you?

02:50.004 --> 02:51.324
If you have a girlfriend,

02:52.403 --> 02:55.044
just say so when you reject my confession.

02:56.164 --> 02:58.164
Instead of beating around the bush.

03:08.284 --> 03:09.604
It's our problem.

03:10.764 --> 03:12.164
So keep it between us.

03:12.803 --> 03:14.204
Why get the others involved?

03:16.683 --> 03:17.963
It was my bad

03:18.724 --> 03:19.924
for leaving you.

03:20.930 --> 03:23.610
But don't you know how young we were back then?

03:23.643 --> 03:25.323
We couldn't even make ends meet.

03:25.324 --> 03:26.443
Under such circumstances,

03:26.444 --> 03:28.642
I didn't see why I had to choose you over my parents.

03:28.643 --> 03:29.563
You're right.

03:30.924 --> 03:32.284
I didn't make you choose.

03:32.884 --> 03:34.363
But you didn't even make things clear.

03:35.493 --> 03:36.363
You dumped me

03:37.523 --> 03:39.004
like I was a dog.

03:42.363 --> 03:43.284
Now tell me.

03:44.363 --> 03:45.523
If you were in my shoes,

03:48.284 --> 03:49.444
why should we get back together?

03:56.444 --> 04:00.363
It's really pointless saying all this now.

04:02.683 --> 04:04.444
All you care about is yourself.

04:05.523 --> 04:07.604
Even if we could turn the clock back,

04:08.563 --> 04:10.284
nothing would change.

04:18.323 --> 04:19.164
Exactly.

04:20.484 --> 04:21.763
If we were to go over this again,

04:22.763 --> 04:24.323
I'd still make that same choice.

04:36.284 --> 04:37.363
You're telling me this

04:39.803 --> 04:41.803
just to make me understand your difficulties.

04:44.003 --> 04:44.803
All right.

04:45.604 --> 04:46.763
I do understand.

04:48.803 --> 04:51.763
But that doesn't lead to our reconciliation.

04:52.363 --> 04:53.484
Even if we reconcile,

04:54.243 --> 04:55.964
when something like this happens again,

04:57.524 --> 04:59.443
you'll still make the same decision.

05:00.164 --> 05:00.964
Am I right?

05:04.084 --> 05:05.724
Getting back a lost candy

05:06.203 --> 05:08.363
won't make it taste special.

05:09.763 --> 05:13.524
No point wasting your love just to make up for regrets.

05:18.563 --> 05:19.363
Xu Qin.

05:23.484 --> 05:24.604
At this age,

05:25.084 --> 05:26.524
I may not be old,

05:27.404 --> 05:28.924
but neither am I young.

05:30.484 --> 05:31.604
I might be able

05:32.323 --> 05:35.323
to endure the pain when I was young.

05:36.203 --> 05:37.443
It'd heal.

05:42.443 --> 05:44.044
But at this age,

05:45.563 --> 05:46.443
I can't afford

05:48.604 --> 05:49.763
to suffer from it again.

05:54.123 --> 05:55.363
Do you still hate me?

05:57.323 --> 05:58.044
No.

05:59.604 --> 06:00.563
I don't hate you.

06:03.003 --> 06:04.644
But I want nothing to do with you.

06:55.044 --> 06:56.363
Why did you come out?

06:57.203 --> 06:58.164
Wear this.

06:58.164 --> 06:58.844
It's alright.

07:04.563 --> 07:05.363
Your ex?

07:08.203 --> 07:09.084
Why?

07:09.763 --> 07:11.123
She asked about you.

07:11.604 --> 07:12.524
I have great intuition.

07:16.164 --> 07:17.442
Since it's over between you,

07:17.443 --> 07:18.724
why won't you give me a chance?

07:22.164 --> 07:22.644
Naturally,

07:23.323 --> 07:24.964
if you have a chance to get back together,

07:25.484 --> 07:26.363
I'll give up.

07:33.164 --> 07:35.443
Whether it's her or you,

07:35.957 --> 07:36.803
there's not a chance.

07:38.803 --> 07:39.924
She's obviously in your heart.

07:40.044 --> 07:41.123
But you're denying it.

07:42.724 --> 07:45.203
Let's not start anything that won't end well.

07:46.484 --> 07:47.323
It's for the best.

08:45.323 --> 08:47.044
Dr. Xu, this is bad.

08:47.244 --> 08:47.884
What is it?

08:47.909 --> 08:51.108
The blood test results of the driver came back.

08:51.224 --> 08:52.100
(Positive)

08:52.124 --> 08:53.723
Did you get hurt in the river?

08:56.443 --> 08:57.404
You're injured.

08:57.563 --> 08:58.203
Hold me.

08:58.843 --> 09:00.124
One, two, three.

09:04.044 --> 09:04.843
I'm fine.

09:05.323 --> 09:07.164
Do you have any wounds? Check thoroughly.

09:07.323 --> 09:08.083
No.

09:08.323 --> 09:10.323
Dr Xu, I'm still single.

09:10.443 --> 09:11.524
Everyone is.

09:12.443 --> 09:13.004
Oh.

09:13.603 --> 09:14.323
Dr Xu,

09:14.603 --> 09:16.924
he was bleeding heavily when you entered the water.

09:17.044 --> 09:17.723
I'm fine.

09:18.244 --> 09:19.524
Our skin is the best barrier.

09:19.723 --> 09:20.764
As long as we don't have a wound

09:21.044 --> 09:22.364
or come in direct contact with the blood or fluid,

09:22.483 --> 09:23.603
there's no risk of infection.

09:24.524 --> 09:26.244
It's the firefighters that are in danger.

09:28.244 --> 09:29.004
Tell the supply room

09:29.284 --> 09:30.963
to disinfect his surgical instruments separately.

09:31.083 --> 09:33.082
The scrubs and medical wastes must be packed separately.

09:33.083 --> 09:35.843
And only reopen the OR at least half an hour after disinfection.

09:35.963 --> 09:37.004
All right. Let's go.

09:47.741 --> 09:48.404
Fall in.

09:49.924 --> 09:50.563
Captain.

09:50.564 --> 09:51.683
Quick.

10:00.284 --> 10:01.683
The rescue team this afternoon,

10:02.284 --> 10:02.924
step out.

10:09.044 --> 10:10.244
Those who came in contact with the sports car's driver,

10:11.203 --> 10:11.803
step out.

10:15.764 --> 10:16.443
Captain,

10:16.563 --> 10:18.364
are we going to be rewarded?

10:18.563 --> 10:19.682
What for, captain?

10:19.683 --> 10:21.643
I'm not a money-grubber like Jiang Yi.

10:21.644 --> 10:22.683
More meat will do.

10:23.884 --> 10:24.524
Come with me.

10:25.364 --> 10:26.004
To the hospital.

10:26.124 --> 10:27.044
It's okay.

10:27.164 --> 10:28.923
I got some scratches, but there's no need to see the doctor.

10:28.924 --> 10:29.963
Yeah. Forget about it.

10:34.644 --> 10:36.004
Go to the hospital

10:38.364 --> 10:39.203
and do a blood test.

10:44.367 --> 10:45.419
(Emergency Department)

10:47.164 --> 10:48.244
Wait.

10:48.483 --> 10:50.523
Why are you taking my son to the isolation ward?

10:50.524 --> 10:52.764
He can't stay at that shabby place.

10:53.483 --> 10:54.644
Listen to me.

10:54.884 --> 10:57.083
I already talked to your administrator, Gao.

10:57.244 --> 10:59.764
Take my son to a private ward right now. At once.

11:00.044 --> 11:01.482
And send two nurses.

11:01.483 --> 11:03.923
I'll pay for your OT and bonuses.

11:03.924 --> 11:04.520
Yes.

11:04.563 --> 11:06.124
Do you know your son's condition?

11:06.644 --> 11:07.884
His blood test results.

11:10.924 --> 11:12.884
My son's been taking medication.

11:13.603 --> 11:15.164
So you knew his health condition.

11:15.404 --> 11:17.004
Why didn't you mention it before the surgery?

11:18.244 --> 11:19.524
That's his privacy.

11:20.483 --> 11:22.283
We're here to get his injuries treated.

11:22.284 --> 11:23.244
Not the disease.

11:23.843 --> 11:25.243
It was an invasive surgery.

11:25.244 --> 11:26.323
What if he infects others?

11:26.963 --> 11:28.124
You're exaggerating.

11:28.244 --> 11:30.244
Don't you sterilise yourselves before a surgery?

11:31.124 --> 11:32.148
I get it now.

11:32.323 --> 11:33.764
You refuse to save him, aren't you?

11:34.244 --> 11:35.524
Your son's life is precious,

11:36.044 --> 11:37.563
but the medical staff's isn't?

11:37.603 --> 11:39.244
And the firefighters who rescued him,

11:39.443 --> 11:40.443
their lives don't matter?

11:40.444 --> 11:41.643
Look at you.

11:41.644 --> 11:43.403
Is this how you talk to the patient's family?

11:43.404 --> 11:45.483
What's going on? Aren't you too rude to the doctor?

11:46.364 --> 11:47.523
I'm talking to the doctor.

11:47.524 --> 11:48.524
It's none of your business.

11:48.525 --> 11:49.682
Mind your own business.

11:49.683 --> 11:50.323
Get lost.

11:50.723 --> 11:51.644
This is the ER.

11:51.963 --> 11:53.044
Please leave.

11:53.524 --> 11:54.203
Who's he?

11:54.364 --> 11:55.602
Who's he to speak here?

11:55.603 --> 11:56.723
Get me the ward already.

11:57.524 --> 11:58.323
They

11:59.404 --> 12:00.723
risked their lives

12:01.404 --> 12:03.644
to save your son from the river. The firefighters.

12:23.800 --> 12:28.841
(Emergency Department)

12:29.244 --> 12:29.924
(Emergency Medicine Laboratory) Thanks, Doctor.

12:29.924 --> 12:30.483
No problem.

12:32.284 --> 12:32.764
Doctor.

12:33.203 --> 12:33.603
Song Yan.

12:33.604 --> 12:35.803
Why're they taking so much of our blood?

12:36.284 --> 12:37.363
Are we infected?

12:37.364 --> 12:38.164
We're not sure.

12:38.244 --> 12:39.403
This is just the protocol.

12:39.404 --> 12:42.004
We need to know your physical condition when dealing with exposure risk.

12:44.364 --> 12:47.244
You may come to the observation room after blood drawing.

12:47.443 --> 12:48.083
This way.

12:49.524 --> 12:50.364
This is scary.

13:20.164 --> 13:21.364
Done. Put pressure on it.

13:23.443 --> 13:24.124
Song Yan.

13:25.803 --> 13:27.764
PEP to prevent the virus from spreading.

13:27.963 --> 13:29.683
More effective if you take it sooner.

13:31.683 --> 13:33.323
This is a single dose enough for three.

13:33.843 --> 13:35.003
We're not a designated hospital.

13:35.004 --> 13:36.164
The dispensary runs out of stock.

13:36.364 --> 13:38.683
We need to get the rest from CDC.

13:40.483 --> 13:41.244
Three medicines

13:41.884 --> 13:42.563
for four of us?

13:43.004 --> 13:45.803
You're wounded and a close contact.

13:46.563 --> 13:48.723
Take it first. You're at the highest risk of infection.

13:54.843 --> 13:56.323
You'll give it to them, right?

14:12.203 --> 14:13.164
How is it going?

14:14.044 --> 14:14.603
Depend on God's will.

14:15.124 --> 14:16.843
Did the doctor give you PEP?

14:17.404 --> 14:18.083
Only those.

14:18.524 --> 14:19.443
We'll get the rest tomorrow.

14:23.171 --> 14:24.810
You three take it first, Captain.

14:25.083 --> 14:26.884
Given my size, I'm sure I'll be fine.

14:27.364 --> 14:28.164
Captain,

14:28.443 --> 14:29.563
your condition is the worst.

14:29.644 --> 14:30.483
You take it first.

14:30.843 --> 14:31.603
Captain,

14:31.924 --> 14:33.404
I only helped carry him.

14:33.884 --> 14:36.124
I'm fit enough to skip the medicine.

14:43.683 --> 14:44.443
Yang Chi.

14:45.404 --> 14:45.884
Jiang Yi.

14:46.843 --> 14:47.644
Liu Jun Ping.

14:47.924 --> 14:48.924
Yes, sir.

14:53.683 --> 14:54.203
Take it.

14:56.044 --> 14:56.843
This is an order.

14:57.603 --> 14:59.164
What about you, Captain?

14:59.364 --> 15:00.443
I'll get mine tomorrow.

15:00.884 --> 15:03.004
-There's enough time. -It'll be pointless by then.

15:03.603 --> 15:06.563
I've checked. The medicine's most effective if taken within two hours.

15:06.924 --> 15:08.124
24 hours is less ideal.

15:09.044 --> 15:09.803
The longer you wait,

15:10.603 --> 15:11.644
the less effective it is.

15:12.244 --> 15:14.203
Let's listen to the doctors.

15:14.843 --> 15:15.483
Come on.

15:16.483 --> 15:17.323
Cheer up.

15:18.364 --> 15:19.563
If anyone's infected,

15:20.524 --> 15:21.924
you must get treated at the best hospital

15:23.237 --> 15:24.563
with advanced medical technology.

15:26.006 --> 15:27.183
This disease will definitely be cured.

15:30.124 --> 15:32.683
As soon as we put on the uniform, we're prepared for it.

15:33.443 --> 15:34.457
I believe

15:35.004 --> 15:37.004
even sacrificing your lives won't make you flinch.

15:37.443 --> 15:38.461
If anything happens,

15:39.044 --> 15:39.995
I'm there for you.

15:40.963 --> 15:42.843
All right, take the medicine.

15:48.884 --> 15:49.443
Go on.

15:51.364 --> 15:52.203
Song Yan,

15:53.723 --> 15:55.404
a reminder to those taking the medicine.

15:56.683 --> 15:59.802
You might have an upset stomach, diarrhoea, a headache and insomnia.

15:59.803 --> 16:00.883
Get enough rest.

16:00.884 --> 16:01.884
Don't exhaust yourselves.

16:03.004 --> 16:03.764
Thank you.

16:04.924 --> 16:07.004
You may go home after taking the medicine.

16:07.764 --> 16:08.443
Song Yan,

16:09.083 --> 16:11.603
you should stay for observation as you didn't take the medicine.

16:13.124 --> 16:13.723
Okay.

16:19.483 --> 16:20.483
Yes.

16:20.603 --> 16:22.203
Our hospital runs out of PEP.

16:23.723 --> 16:25.363
If you may, please ask CDC

16:25.364 --> 16:27.004
to send it to us as soon as possible.

16:32.483 --> 16:33.963
All right. Thank you.

16:43.559 --> 16:45.559
(Emergency Department)

16:54.044 --> 16:54.764
Dr Xu.

16:54.924 --> 16:55.764
Thank you.

17:37.644 --> 17:38.924
Here, the medicine.

17:48.924 --> 17:49.523
Thanks.

17:51.884 --> 17:53.683
That's my line.

17:54.683 --> 17:56.124
You saved me.

18:02.164 --> 18:03.844
Don't feel burdened.

18:05.283 --> 18:07.564
This is my responsibility.

18:23.243 --> 18:25.003
I'm mature enough

18:26.084 --> 18:27.124
to respect your decision

18:28.124 --> 18:29.723
after you said that you

18:31.763 --> 18:33.003
wanted nothing to do with me.

19:22.050 --> 19:23.730
(China Fire and Rescue)

19:34.003 --> 19:35.203
What's you plan for the future?

19:36.443 --> 19:38.164
Continue to stay at Shili Tai?

19:38.804 --> 19:39.683
Future?

19:42.324 --> 19:43.324
I haven't given it a thought.

19:44.683 --> 19:47.364
I just want to focus on what I'm doing now.

19:48.723 --> 19:49.604
And you?

19:51.364 --> 19:53.124
Well, I can't only think about myself.

19:53.763 --> 19:55.084
My parents have aged

19:55.604 --> 19:56.644
with health issues.

19:57.364 --> 19:59.084
I haven't been able to spend time with them.

19:59.804 --> 20:02.424
My fiancee and I aren't officially married.

20:03.924 --> 20:07.963
Yet she has to handle all sorts of things in the family.

20:09.283 --> 20:10.364
For five years straight.

20:11.844 --> 20:14.483
I need to give it back to them.

20:16.844 --> 20:18.324
So you're going to quit?

20:21.124 --> 20:21.963
I haven't decided.

20:25.243 --> 20:26.324
That crossed your mind?

20:26.804 --> 20:28.804
Listen. Don't even think about it.

20:29.683 --> 20:31.804
Why? You can't bear to see me go?

20:33.963 --> 20:35.404
It's troublesome to get a new guy.

20:44.003 --> 20:46.164
Do you know what your biggest problem is?

20:47.243 --> 20:48.324
Not admitting your true feelings.

20:50.324 --> 20:53.043
Be honest about your feelings.

20:53.644 --> 20:54.924
Isn't being stubborn tired?

20:55.763 --> 20:57.404
Admit that you're reluctant to let me go.

20:58.043 --> 20:58.844
Fine.

20:59.683 --> 21:01.564
I'm pleading you.

21:02.043 --> 21:02.844
Don't go.

21:05.283 --> 21:07.003
The newbies aren't ready yet.

21:07.443 --> 21:09.884
Don't dump the responsibility on me.

21:10.884 --> 21:14.124
I can let you take the credits, rewards and allowances

21:16.124 --> 21:17.283
before me after this.

21:18.604 --> 21:19.604
You sure are generous.

21:20.203 --> 21:21.364
Of course.

21:21.963 --> 21:23.043
We're close, aren't we?

21:24.443 --> 21:25.884
Let's go somewhere.

21:35.043 --> 21:36.604
Another full-day training tomorrow.

21:37.003 --> 21:38.003
Boring.

21:40.763 --> 21:41.963
I'm regretting this already.

21:42.564 --> 21:44.163
If I'm allowed to quit now,

21:44.164 --> 21:45.764
I'll get a flight ticket home right away.

21:46.164 --> 21:47.403
Lower your voice.

21:47.404 --> 21:48.443
Luckily, the squad leader isn't here.

21:48.804 --> 21:49.483
If he hears you...

21:49.484 --> 21:50.564
This is where

21:51.283 --> 21:52.844
you get to know what they're thinking.

21:53.523 --> 21:54.283
Listen.

21:54.943 --> 21:56.783
A close friend of mine passed the aviation test

21:57.164 --> 21:58.682
and is flying trainers aircraft

21:58.683 --> 22:00.364
at the aviation school every day.

22:00.763 --> 22:01.404
But look at us.

22:01.924 --> 22:03.364
All we do is water the plants.

22:03.844 --> 22:04.884
Until we're dog-tired.

22:05.164 --> 22:05.924
Exactly.

22:09.054 --> 22:09.644
Ge.

22:10.844 --> 22:11.884
Why did you join the brigade?

22:12.523 --> 22:13.043
Me?

22:14.443 --> 22:15.164
To save lives.

22:15.604 --> 22:16.243
Dude,

22:16.523 --> 22:17.404
seriously?

22:18.283 --> 22:19.924
I want to be like Captain Song.

22:22.364 --> 22:23.483
Why are you laughing?

22:23.924 --> 22:24.844
Annoying.

22:26.884 --> 22:29.084
Ge's girlfriend likes heroes.

22:29.124 --> 22:30.683
She admires him.

22:31.203 --> 22:33.844
Hero? One who's never even been into a burning building?

22:34.164 --> 22:35.644
Where does the admiration come from?

22:36.124 --> 22:38.804
You're used to eavesdropping here?

22:39.763 --> 22:41.682
Trying to figure out what they're thinking

22:41.683 --> 22:44.084
is also part of the instructor's job.

22:45.164 --> 22:47.723
You and your excuses.

22:52.043 --> 22:52.924
The captain just went by.

22:53.644 --> 22:54.924
The instructor too.

22:58.364 --> 23:00.042
Get your equipment and fall in.

23:00.043 --> 23:01.203
Squad leaders, take command.

23:01.243 --> 23:01.924
Squad One.

23:02.243 --> 23:03.243
Running march. March.

23:03.243 --> 23:03.924
Squad Two.

23:03.925 --> 23:04.962
Running march. March.

23:04.963 --> 23:09.763
One, two, one.

23:17.924 --> 23:18.604
Hi, Chi.

23:21.124 --> 23:21.804
Vice Captain.

23:22.523 --> 23:23.283
Hi, Chi.

23:29.043 --> 23:29.723
Jiang.

23:31.203 --> 23:32.203
The hospital called.

23:32.324 --> 23:33.243
All tested negative.

23:33.244 --> 23:34.644
The follow-up appointment is in four weeks.

23:35.003 --> 23:35.683
Really?

23:36.043 --> 23:36.844
Thank goodness.

23:37.203 --> 23:38.043
Let me tell you.

23:38.243 --> 23:39.723
Be it negative or not,

23:40.443 --> 23:41.443
I can't stand it anymore.

23:41.444 --> 23:42.523
How many times did you throw up?

23:42.924 --> 23:43.763
Four.

23:47.043 --> 23:47.644
Jun Ping.

23:47.644 --> 23:48.324
Chi.

23:48.723 --> 23:49.203
Liu.

23:52.963 --> 23:54.723
-Where're you going? -Sorry.

23:55.124 --> 23:55.804
I just vomited,

23:56.523 --> 23:57.963
but you make me want to vomit again.

23:58.644 --> 24:00.523
What? We make you want to vomit?

24:31.001 --> 24:33.247
(Application for Relocation)

24:42.164 --> 24:43.483
You're supposed to rest.

24:43.963 --> 24:44.844
Why aren't you in bed?

24:58.924 --> 25:00.243
What's this for?

25:03.243 --> 25:04.564
To become a deserter?

25:09.043 --> 25:10.683
You've applied for a transfer.

25:11.364 --> 25:13.924
Why bother asking for my opinion the other day?

25:16.203 --> 25:18.963
Who was it that suggested to carry the burden together?

25:19.443 --> 25:20.482
Who was it

25:20.483 --> 25:23.404
that wanted to train the newbies into great firefighters?

25:23.763 --> 25:24.644
And who promised

25:24.645 --> 25:26.643
to make sure the Yancheng's Guardian Cup trophy

25:26.644 --> 25:28.164
remain in Shili Tai forever?

25:29.604 --> 25:30.364
Listen, Song Yan.

25:30.365 --> 25:32.043
Just tell me your plan!

25:43.324 --> 25:44.203
Suo Jun.

25:45.528 --> 25:47.408
You were writing the application behind my back.

25:49.924 --> 25:51.523
What did I do

25:52.243 --> 25:54.163
to deserve being neglected by you?

25:54.164 --> 25:55.529
You didn't even discuss it with me.

25:57.924 --> 25:58.644
Fine.

25:59.884 --> 26:01.042
Even if you're not up for discussion,

26:01.043 --> 26:02.683
at least let me know about it.

26:05.324 --> 26:08.604
We eat and sleep under one roof.

26:11.203 --> 26:13.003
Why keep me in the dark?

26:16.364 --> 26:18.203
I wanted to ask for your opinion.

26:19.084 --> 26:20.843
But I thought you'd get too worked up...

26:20.844 --> 26:22.443
Yet you secretly wrote the application.

26:24.989 --> 26:27.669
What, you planned to tell me only after you've left?

26:28.844 --> 26:30.763
Or you never planned to?

26:34.404 --> 26:36.523
"See you, Song Yan."

26:37.084 --> 26:38.243
"Bye, Song Yan."

26:38.483 --> 26:39.523
"Never see each other again."

26:40.084 --> 26:40.844
Is that your plan?

26:46.644 --> 26:49.963
Remember the oath we took when we formed a team?

26:55.523 --> 26:56.723
You don't.

26:57.483 --> 26:58.884
You forgot all of it,

26:59.644 --> 27:02.203
abandoning your responsibilities and duties.

27:03.483 --> 27:06.203
You're a deserter!

27:07.884 --> 27:08.804
Song Yan,

27:10.763 --> 27:12.644
I remember the oath we took.

27:13.924 --> 27:15.283
And I'm not becoming a deserter.

27:17.084 --> 27:18.564
But I have things to take care of.

27:20.483 --> 27:21.283
You know,

27:22.324 --> 27:23.203
I'm relocating

27:24.164 --> 27:26.084
to a position that pays an extra 1,200 yuan.

27:26.763 --> 27:27.483
I can...

27:27.484 --> 27:28.644
So it's for money?

27:32.523 --> 27:33.283
Yes.

27:35.084 --> 27:36.283
If you believe so.

27:38.604 --> 27:40.644
Why push yourself to this extent, Song Yan?

27:42.203 --> 27:45.844
The Guardian Cup trophy can be kept by fire stations other than ours.

27:47.003 --> 27:49.963
We're all firefighters protecting the same city,

27:51.043 --> 27:52.364
as well as its citizen.

27:54.397 --> 27:56.317
Why must it stay here?

28:09.243 --> 28:10.043
Suo Jun,

28:11.483 --> 28:13.644
so you can see the bigger picture.

28:15.523 --> 28:16.164
You're right.

28:16.165 --> 28:17.483
I can't claim all credits.

28:18.124 --> 28:21.443
The trophy is the whole brigade's honour.

28:22.324 --> 28:25.043
But we're the warriors of Shili Tai, mind you.

28:33.804 --> 28:34.963
You're leaving.

28:35.564 --> 28:38.844
The honour doesn't matter to you.

28:41.804 --> 28:43.404
You'd leave your teammates,

28:44.203 --> 28:46.483
turn your back to the newbies,

28:48.124 --> 28:50.164
and apply for a transfer

28:51.443 --> 28:52.604
for the 1,200 pay.

28:55.003 --> 28:55.844
All right.

28:57.963 --> 28:59.164
I won't stop you.

29:10.243 --> 29:11.884
If you refuse

29:13.644 --> 29:14.644
to carry Shili Tai's flag,

29:16.763 --> 29:17.924
I'll do it myself.

30:11.003 --> 30:12.482
I'm getting days off after this week.

30:12.483 --> 30:13.884
What about you, Dr Xu?

30:14.443 --> 30:15.124
Me too.

30:15.125 --> 30:16.364
Want to hang out?

30:16.604 --> 30:17.124
Sure.

30:17.523 --> 30:18.443
I'd rather sleep.

30:18.763 --> 30:19.924
We can do that together too.

30:26.043 --> 30:27.124
Hi, this is the ER.

30:31.763 --> 30:32.564
Got it.

30:33.443 --> 30:34.084
Dr Xu.

30:34.364 --> 30:35.643
A patient is arriving.

30:35.644 --> 30:37.364
Weak pulse, unconscious, unstable vital signs.

30:37.884 --> 30:39.283
-Get the resuscitation room ready. -Okay.

30:43.043 --> 30:44.522
Administer 1mg IV adrenaline.

30:44.523 --> 30:45.164
Okay.

30:49.404 --> 30:50.884
1mg IV adrenaline.

31:18.564 --> 31:19.404
-Let me do it. -Okay.

31:25.644 --> 31:26.564
Check the venous access.

31:29.243 --> 31:30.164
First shock, 200 joules.

31:30.164 --> 31:30.763
Back off.

31:39.243 --> 31:39.884
300 joules.

31:40.844 --> 31:41.804
300 joules, confirmed.

32:20.523 --> 32:21.324
Don't relax yet.

32:21.324 --> 32:22.043
Stay focused.

32:22.043 --> 32:22.564
Okay.

32:30.366 --> 32:34.645
(Thrive)

32:56.283 --> 32:56.804
Is that it?

32:57.483 --> 32:58.604
Isn't this too easy?

32:58.924 --> 32:59.604
Pi Pi,

32:59.844 --> 33:01.604
while the seniors are busy putting out fires,

33:01.763 --> 33:03.644
all we do is watering plants.

33:03.844 --> 33:04.804
What's the point?

33:04.805 --> 33:06.282
This is so different.

33:06.283 --> 33:07.084
Exactly.

33:07.124 --> 33:09.124
We're repeating the same drill over and over.

33:09.243 --> 33:11.164
How boring. They're not the real deal.

33:11.763 --> 33:13.363
How long is this going to continue?

33:13.364 --> 33:14.804
As if I know the answer.

33:15.043 --> 33:15.884
I do.

33:18.124 --> 33:18.763
Captain.

33:18.764 --> 33:20.762
You can't even do the basic trainings properly.

33:20.763 --> 33:21.844
You have the audacity to complain?

33:22.084 --> 33:22.723
Suit up.

33:23.164 --> 33:23.804
Fall in.

33:24.043 --> 33:24.884
Roger.

33:26.723 --> 33:27.604
Let's go.

35:33.684 --> 35:34.443
All of you.

35:34.844 --> 35:35.523
Suit up.

35:35.804 --> 35:37.043
Roger.

35:37.884 --> 35:38.724
Let's do it.

36:34.123 --> 36:34.963
What's wrong with you?

36:35.483 --> 36:36.043
Chi.

36:44.963 --> 36:46.443
You're eager to work on the front line

36:46.523 --> 36:48.643
and put out fire, aren't you?

36:49.523 --> 36:51.083
Yet you can't even hold the fire hose.

36:51.764 --> 36:53.284
You want to be a laughing stock or what?

36:55.724 --> 36:56.924
You train every day.

36:57.643 --> 37:00.123
And this is what you've got?

37:01.924 --> 37:03.764
Look at every single one of you.

37:04.643 --> 37:05.764
You're just going to

37:06.643 --> 37:08.244
embarrass Shili Tai in the competition!

37:12.684 --> 37:13.603
Five detachments.

37:14.443 --> 37:15.603
Hundreds of participants.

37:16.003 --> 37:17.003
Nine events.

37:17.603 --> 37:18.804
How're you going to compete?

37:19.643 --> 37:20.643
What're you capable of?

37:26.443 --> 37:27.804
Practise makes perfect.

37:29.003 --> 37:30.123
They need time to adapt.

37:32.244 --> 37:33.324
You're giving them time?

37:33.804 --> 37:34.844
What about my time?

37:35.204 --> 37:36.483
Our time?

37:59.284 --> 38:00.563
Pack all the things up

38:00.963 --> 38:02.003
and take a hot shower.

38:02.324 --> 38:03.163
In case you catch a cold.

38:07.844 --> 38:08.523
Dismiss.

38:08.963 --> 38:10.043
What's wrong with Captain?

38:10.204 --> 38:11.643
He never treated the instructor like that.

38:12.963 --> 38:13.724
He's scary.

38:15.123 --> 38:16.563
Captain must be very disappointed.

38:16.924 --> 38:18.204
Forget about it. Let's go.

38:27.404 --> 38:28.043
Doctor,

38:28.044 --> 38:29.163
how did it go?

38:29.324 --> 38:30.123
Don't worry.

38:30.124 --> 38:31.482
His heartbeat has resumed.

38:31.483 --> 38:32.404
It was heart attack.

38:32.523 --> 38:34.323
He'll be taken to do angiography.

38:34.324 --> 38:35.523
He might need a stent.

38:35.603 --> 38:37.083
You should discuss among yourselves.

38:37.483 --> 38:39.363
Great. This is great.

38:39.364 --> 38:40.442
Thank you very much.

38:40.443 --> 38:41.603
The patient is coming out.

38:42.003 --> 38:42.963
Please don't mind this.

38:42.964 --> 38:44.002
Thank you.

38:44.003 --> 38:46.122
What do I do if you can't bring him back?

38:46.123 --> 38:47.403
Come have a meal at our place.

38:47.404 --> 38:49.403
Thank you.

38:49.404 --> 38:50.683
Please wait here.

38:50.684 --> 38:52.243
Thank you.

38:52.244 --> 38:55.002
Thank you for your hard work.

38:55.003 --> 38:56.442
Thank you.

38:56.443 --> 38:57.123
See you.

38:59.364 --> 39:00.443
He's coming out.

39:01.204 --> 39:02.324
-How are you feeling? -Brother.

39:02.404 --> 39:03.844
-Are you all right? -How are you feeling?

39:31.043 --> 39:31.844
Anything else?

39:35.083 --> 39:35.684
No.

40:32.043 --> 40:33.083
Dig in.

40:35.963 --> 40:38.043
Are you three feeling better?

40:38.163 --> 40:39.003
Much better.

40:39.804 --> 40:42.042
All the vomiting is killing me.

40:42.043 --> 40:42.844
We're great,

40:42.884 --> 40:44.082
but don't mention that word.

40:44.083 --> 40:45.003
It weakens my legs.

40:45.004 --> 40:46.523
Your legs are weak anyway.

40:47.804 --> 40:48.483
Instructor,

40:49.083 --> 40:51.243
I envy Captain Song for having that body.

40:51.244 --> 40:53.083
He isn't experiencing any side effects.

40:53.163 --> 40:56.043
That mean look of his can even scare unlucky vibe away.

41:01.324 --> 41:03.123
Looks like Captain is still angry.

41:03.284 --> 41:04.284
That's for sure.

41:04.724 --> 41:06.563
They won't be reconciling anytime soon.
